{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/fc53df61dbf7c2a605b181727f8accf9.avif?t=1755041876\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! We\u2019re Banjihagames, the indie game studio behind Elementail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the official release, we're offering a free demo version of Elementail for you to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that the demo includes only a portion of the full game content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be able to play Act 1 of the full game\u2014which spans three acts and a final boss battle\u2014in this free demo version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike the full version, the demo allows you to play as only one character, and leveling up is disabled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain features such as the encyclopedia, stats, and rankings are also restricted in this version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version will continue to be updated, including improvements to save/load, missing relics, visual design, and other incomplete features.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll carefully review all of your ideas and feedback to make sure the full release is the best it can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your support and interest mean the world to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s an honor and a joy to build Elementail together with all of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve poured countless late nights into crafting exciting strategy within the simplest mechanics: Draw, Store, and Strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 150 cards and relics, we\u2019ve been eager to share the joy of Elementail with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you fall in battle,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >don\u2019t worry\u2014you\u2019ll come back stronger, ready to try a new strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear your thoughts as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback helps us grow and make Elementail even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >please tell us your feedback on our Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/d1901a011c81f9cc465ce4205ab54d98.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/5f08fd0aa435a09e722f8e478fc72c97.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/5f08fd0aa435a09e722f8e478fc72c97.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/5f08fd0aa435a09e722f8e478fc72c97.mp4?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set off on a magical journey with adorable animal wizards, harnessing the power of Water, Fire, and Lightning elemental cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elementail is a casual roguelike deckbuilder with the feel of a luxurious board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s easy and intuitive\u2014yes, even a squirrel could play it!\u2014but you'll need clever strategy to overcome quirky enemies and unexpected challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a world where enchanted animals and elemental spirits coexist,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you play as a rookie wizard setting out to stop the growing elemental corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes, the game\u2019s addictive card-drawing is a bit of a problem... but in the most lovable way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/cec98e0e6682d60ae6a591af7ba51d3f.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/8993a4c3ec1f6ba5805d8153e1a4cb75.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/8993a4c3ec1f6ba5805d8153e1a4cb75.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in Elementail is easy to learn but packed with strategic choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Draw] / [Store] / [Strike]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw as many cards as you like from your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them to build up damage and strike down your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash same-element cards in a row for massive magical attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or mix different elements for unpredictable combos and wild effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/19cdf197a8a67655f9b8766f054be310.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/bd4231b32e97a65cd166047a485fd7ad.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/bd4231b32e97a65cd166047a485fd7ad.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Just one more card...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware your inner greed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overdrawing could ruin your combo in an instant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/c76bbf82944715ed148fa15b27d0c18a.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/9643bd1530e975bd11ae8cd83081361e.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/9643bd1530e975bd11ae8cd83081361e.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack anytime, in any way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How often, how hard, and how you attack is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will try to disrupt your strategy with their own patterns and tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of cards in your deck? That\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So plan carefully and adapt on the fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you sneak around danger like a cunning mouse or charge forward head-on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Elementail lets you fight your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/c62eee51ff8fb6219882f08e5fdb1754.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/3570c376e56fd4cbd002d6e1229c3627.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/3570c376e56fd4cbd002d6e1229c3627.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Did your powerful combo just fizzle out?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re an adorable animal wizard, after all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store cards in your \u201ccheeks\u201d to hold them for the perfect moment, then release them all at once for satisfying chain attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixing elements in advance is another great strategy to unleash devastating effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/1463a2a62823d60562062c8924a02751.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/bb1d45f72f86d9c00f03bf159370e006.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Elementail, animal wizards carry elemental spirits sealed into magical \u201ccards.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cards can be enhanced through coating, seals, and power-ups, giving you a wide range of customization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Craft your signature card!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/e6e0d9da6e4991007fb6ced24b836e58.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/9d258034e154c22e9b13d296b294352b.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/9d258034e154c22e9b13d296b294352b.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/9d258034e154c22e9b13d296b294352b.mp4?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards aren\u2019t just paper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can be enhanced with glass, metal, and more to gain unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/024a3e3e2ccc90852c91f6aac06a4541.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/6aa42c18abc62fd7ebdbc5d15a2f9a7f.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/6aa42c18abc62fd7ebdbc5d15a2f9a7f.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/6aa42c18abc62fd7ebdbc5d15a2f9a7f.mp4?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why stop at one spirit per card?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamp in new elements and unlock combo possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/8df3b36a244cc5e7c0515b53d3a707ba.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/74b07eaecff39f4f736f96216c2190e1.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/74b07eaecff39f4f736f96216c2190e1.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/74b07eaecff39f4f736f96216c2190e1.mp4?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse cards with mana to boost their damage and impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/65307a913323456a12d56a661866cc43.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/996bbc2f89f9907dc54acbd94a66320a.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 relics await you throughout the world of Elementail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one offers powerful, unique effects that shape your strategy and amplify your deck. Experiment, combine, and build your own legendary playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/cee7c0fd1c7fe5c375d75c91f796f0d5.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/5598555ea39d4771081536c336b3b1a6.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You\u2019re all set\u2014time to dive into the adventure!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore branching paths, collect powerful cards and relics, and face off against the wicked wizard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The world of Elementail is teetering on the edge. It\u2019s up to you\u2014and your cheeky animal wizard friends\u2014to save it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Draw. Store. Strike.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw cards from your deck and store them in your cheek-pouches (yes, literally!), then unleash them all at once at the perfect moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain same-element cards for explosive combos\u2014or mix elements for wild, unpredictable effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>150+ Relics &amp; Full Customization</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden corners of the map to discover relics that enhance your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coat your cards in glass or metal, inscribe them with arcane sigils, and give each one its own unique powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps &amp; Events</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different\u2014new routes, shops, traps, and boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe like a sneaky mouse or charge forward boldly. It\u2019s all about finding the path that suits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Adorable Animal Wizards &amp; a Magical World</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet squirrel, rabbit, and cat wizards\u2014each with their own charm\u2014who guide you through a whimsical, immersive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dreamy music and responsive sound effects, the adventure feels alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of cards and you\u2019ll be defeated\u2014but with each run, you\u2019ll collect new relics and skills to come back stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face quirky monsters, uncover special events, and craft your perfect deck in this ever-changing journey.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918540?t=1755041876","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/95aca33e612b309acabb7919f57fc5dfba9eeac6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755041876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/6664a29b2eefd7002bde0f4ce2bf0fe94367902f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755041876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/6664a29b2eefd7002bde0f4ce2bf0fe94367902f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755041876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/fc53df61dbf7c2a605b181727f8accf9.avif?t=1755041876\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! We\u2019re Banjihagames, the indie game studio behind Elementail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before the official release, we're offering a free demo version of Elementail for you to try.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that the demo includes only a portion of the full game content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll be able to play Act 1 of the full game\u2014which spans three acts and a final boss battle\u2014in this free demo version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike the full version, the demo allows you to play as only one character, and leveling up is disabled.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Certain features such as the encyclopedia, stats, and rankings are also restricted in this version.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo version will continue to be updated, including improvements to save/load, missing relics, visual design, and other incomplete features.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll carefully review all of your ideas and feedback to make sure the full release is the best it can be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your support and interest mean the world to us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s an honor and a joy to build Elementail together with all of you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve poured countless late nights into crafting exciting strategy within the simplest mechanics: Draw, Store, and Strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 150 cards and relics, we\u2019ve been eager to share the joy of Elementail with you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you fall in battle,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >don\u2019t worry\u2014you\u2019ll come back stronger, ready to try a new strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019d love to hear your thoughts as you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback helps us grow and make Elementail even better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >please tell us your feedback on our Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/d1901a011c81f9cc465ce4205ab54d98.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/5f08fd0aa435a09e722f8e478fc72c97.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/5f08fd0aa435a09e722f8e478fc72c97.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/5f08fd0aa435a09e722f8e478fc72c97.mp4?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set off on a magical journey with adorable animal wizards, harnessing the power of Water, Fire, and Lightning elemental cards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elementail is a casual roguelike deckbuilder with the feel of a luxurious board game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s easy and intuitive\u2014yes, even a squirrel could play it!\u2014but you'll need clever strategy to overcome quirky enemies and unexpected challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In a world where enchanted animals and elemental spirits coexist,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you play as a rookie wizard setting out to stop the growing elemental corruption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes, the game\u2019s addictive card-drawing is a bit of a problem... but in the most lovable way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/cec98e0e6682d60ae6a591af7ba51d3f.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/8993a4c3ec1f6ba5805d8153e1a4cb75.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/8993a4c3ec1f6ba5805d8153e1a4cb75.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in Elementail is easy to learn but packed with strategic choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Draw] / [Store] / [Strike]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw as many cards as you like from your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use them to build up damage and strike down your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash same-element cards in a row for massive magical attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or mix different elements for unpredictable combos and wild effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/19cdf197a8a67655f9b8766f054be310.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/bd4231b32e97a65cd166047a485fd7ad.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/bd4231b32e97a65cd166047a485fd7ad.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Just one more card...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beware your inner greed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overdrawing could ruin your combo in an instant!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/c76bbf82944715ed148fa15b27d0c18a.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/9643bd1530e975bd11ae8cd83081361e.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/9643bd1530e975bd11ae8cd83081361e.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack anytime, in any way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How often, how hard, and how you attack is entirely up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies will try to disrupt your strategy with their own patterns and tricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of cards in your deck? That\u2019s game over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So plan carefully and adapt on the fly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you sneak around danger like a cunning mouse or charge forward head-on!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Elementail lets you fight your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/c62eee51ff8fb6219882f08e5fdb1754.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/3570c376e56fd4cbd002d6e1229c3627.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/3570c376e56fd4cbd002d6e1229c3627.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Did your powerful combo just fizzle out?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No worries\u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re an adorable animal wizard, after all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store cards in your \u201ccheeks\u201d to hold them for the perfect moment, then release them all at once for satisfying chain attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixing elements in advance is another great strategy to unleash devastating effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/1463a2a62823d60562062c8924a02751.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/bb1d45f72f86d9c00f03bf159370e006.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Elementail, animal wizards carry elemental spirits sealed into magical \u201ccards.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cards can be enhanced through coating, seals, and power-ups, giving you a wide range of customization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Craft your signature card!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/e6e0d9da6e4991007fb6ced24b836e58.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/9d258034e154c22e9b13d296b294352b.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/9d258034e154c22e9b13d296b294352b.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/9d258034e154c22e9b13d296b294352b.mp4?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cards aren\u2019t just paper!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They can be enhanced with glass, metal, and more to gain unique effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/024a3e3e2ccc90852c91f6aac06a4541.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/6aa42c18abc62fd7ebdbc5d15a2f9a7f.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/6aa42c18abc62fd7ebdbc5d15a2f9a7f.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/6aa42c18abc62fd7ebdbc5d15a2f9a7f.mp4?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why stop at one spirit per card?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stamp in new elements and unlock combo possibilities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/8df3b36a244cc5e7c0515b53d3a707ba.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/74b07eaecff39f4f736f96216c2190e1.poster.avif?t=1755041876\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/74b07eaecff39f4f736f96216c2190e1.webm?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/74b07eaecff39f4f736f96216c2190e1.mp4?t=1755041876\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse cards with mana to boost their damage and impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/65307a913323456a12d56a661866cc43.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/996bbc2f89f9907dc54acbd94a66320a.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 150 relics await you throughout the world of Elementail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one offers powerful, unique effects that shape your strategy and amplify your deck. Experiment, combine, and build your own legendary playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/cee7c0fd1c7fe5c375d75c91f796f0d5.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/extras/5598555ea39d4771081536c336b3b1a6.avif?t=1755041876\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You\u2019re all set\u2014time to dive into the adventure!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore branching paths, collect powerful cards and relics, and face off against the wicked wizard!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The world of Elementail is teetering on the edge. It\u2019s up to you\u2014and your cheeky animal wizard friends\u2014to save it.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Draw. Store. Strike.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw cards from your deck and store them in your cheek-pouches (yes, literally!), then unleash them all at once at the perfect moment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain same-element cards for explosive combos\u2014or mix elements for wild, unpredictable effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>150+ Relics &amp; Full Customization</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore hidden corners of the map to discover relics that enhance your deck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coat your cards in glass or metal, inscribe them with arcane sigils, and give each one its own unique powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps &amp; Events</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different\u2014new routes, shops, traps, and boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe like a sneaky mouse or charge forward boldly. It\u2019s all about finding the path that suits your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Adorable Animal Wizards &amp; a Magical World</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet squirrel, rabbit, and cat wizards\u2014each with their own charm\u2014who guide you through a whimsical, immersive world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dreamy music and responsive sound effects, the adventure feels alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Endless Replayability</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run out of cards and you\u2019ll be defeated\u2014but with each run, you\u2019ll collect new relics and skills to come back stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face quirky monsters, uncover special events, and craft your perfect deck in this ever-changing journey.</p>","developers":["banjihagames"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3839890","name":"Elementail"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918540/1a7357ae874b5f66d6939a5bd8abd1b18a4f9ed0/header.jpg?t=1755041876","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 /